+ * \default \c 44100
+ * \param  encoder  An encoder instance to set.
+ * \param  value    See above.
+ * \assert
+ *    \code encoder != NULL \endcode
+ * \retval FLAC__bool
+ *    \c false if the encoder is already initialized, else \c true.
